    "name": "Short Short Fictions",
    "steam_appid": 3617080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you could get any wish granted at the very end of your life... What wish would you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hellooo, everyone! The name's Newy. I'm a magical wish-granting game console. I just looove short stories that linger in your heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Short Fictions is an omnibus of three retro short adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three titles included are the complete ports of DON'T SAY YES and TO:NORTH, short games that gained wide attention on social media, and IMMEMORIAL, a secret new game. All three are painful, toilful, yet beautiful short stories that you can finish within thirty minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/b77e51f9b5d962aded89714c68d996d6.poster.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/b77e51f9b5d962aded89714c68d996d6.webm?t=1752122673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/b77e51f9b5d962aded89714c68d996d6.mp4?t=1752122673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting these stories is yet another story for you to play through! It's essentially a whole other game for you to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the new but familiar game console NewWave by your side, enjoy a slightly fantastical short short collection of extraordinary stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with the NewWave!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/a189c3c304f9fd1e38858e4bacf55942.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DON'T SAY YES and TO:NORTH, short games released on itch.io that gained wide attention on social media, have been fully ported to a new engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fictional retro game console NewWave plays games on cassette tapes, so you can feel like you are actually playing the games on their own console. Listen to the rain and waves under the beautiful scenery of the changing weather and immerse yourself into the world of these stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/892b2087be2c0c0391ac81a8215aee1c.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/f8b24bdf0343c72d08facc9cc51132c3.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the games you can play in this collection are about not being able to do something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/37510ae0bd33f1b0ae99cd01eaa48a8c.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOST AND FOUND: A story for the sake of the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click adventure game for you to enjoy while you go from one game to another. It functions as a bridge between games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Newy, a self-proclaimed magical game console, has the power to grant any wish.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The protagonist Sasaki earns one day off through Newy's magic but is trapped at a mysterious beach in exchange. She needs to find a game cassette for Newy in order to leave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, the two of them run into a strange fighter ship called Unit-1001NIGHTS. He claims he will assist Sasaki's escape if his own dream is fulfilled. And the extraordinary wish in question...?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical game console Newy (that's me!) has the power to grant wishes! And the more games you play, the stronger that magic gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Newy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A super handy machine that can play games from cassette tapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sasaki</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist. She got a one-day holiday through magic and is enjoying it to the fullest. She is no good with machines, and today is the first time she's ever played a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit-1001NIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A broken fighter ship you meet at the beach. He is troubled by a burning-hot first love. And the target of that love? Well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally have a day off, so you have to play the day away! That's why I've made this magical private beach just for you. There's even a picnic and beach umbrella. Just relax and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You want to leave the beach? No, you have to stay here. There's nothing out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/108c228b8a353020b522a8f78dace4df.avif?t=1752122673\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T SAY YES: A game where you can't say yes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very short text adventure that was highly rated by itch.io players, where you follow just one simple rule for a rich experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Year 22xx in the Lunic Calendar.</i><br><i>A spaceship crashed into the moon, and a strange being tries to make a deal with the dying pilot...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just select YES or NO. A very short game that only takes five minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/99e973473c73364541240a0854f96be9.avif?t=1752122673\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TO:NORTH: An adventure where you just can't go south</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traditional top-down adventure that gained attention on social media for how its story meshed closely with its concept. Available in languages other than Japanese for the first time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take me north. Don't look south no matter what.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an AI and take the protagonist to their destination, but you can't go south no matter what. What happens if you look south...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/0312fd150304aca64b4d1b0260db8874.poster.avif?t=1752122673\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/0312fd150304aca64b4d1b0260db8874.webp?t=1752122673\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMEMORIAL: A game where you can't  XXXXXX XXXXX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret new short game created for this collection. Look for it within LOST AND FOUND.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I realized, and so, I had to do it. But exactly did I realize?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617080/extras/9cae2f0143e7b918a368c62503987f9a.avif?t=1752122673\" width=100 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a new game that even I don't know about yet! I wonder what it's about.</p>",
